<https://w3id.org/function/ontology#Implementation> a owl:Class.
<https://w3id.org/function/vocabulary/implementation> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "The Function Ontology Implementation vocabulary specifies terms relevant to structure fno:Implementations. The specification is online at https://w3id.org/function/spec"@en;
